{"root":{"data":{"id":"dbwl1jeyzgw0","created":1754609175339,"text":"上下文不忠实性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl1nh2gk00","created":1754609184173,"text":"内在幻觉"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl28vvvg80","created":1754609230782,"text":"Semantic Frame Errors（语义框架错误）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl29mh9k00","created":1754609232390,"text":"Predicate Error (PredE)谓词错误","note":"动词表达错误，比如原文里是“批准”，但是输出是“拒绝”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2hvhubc0","created":1754609250349,"text":"Entity Error\n(EntE)主体错误","note":"输出的事件主体出错了，比如原文说的是新冠，结果输出出来成埃博拉了"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2jvcsuw0","created":1754609254694,"text":"Circumstance\nError (CircE)情景错误"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwlw1nbxb40","created":1754611565952,"text":"时间漂移"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwlw2ifcxk0","created":1754611567832,"text":"地点漂移"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwlw3agx2o0","created":1754611569528,"text":"方式漂移"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2fqm5y00","created":1754609245701,"text":"Discourse Errors（篇章错误）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwl2le95w00","created":1754609258014,"text":"Co-reference Error(CorefE)共指错误","note":"代词指代错误，如“they”指代不明，指代错误"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2mcibvk0","created":1754609260085,"text":"Discourse Link Error(LinkE)链接错误","note":"上下句间逻辑关系确缺失，比如前后句顺序混乱等"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dbwl2571aug0","created":1754609222749,"text":"外在幻觉"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwlxwcxx9c0","created":1754611711168,"text":"Factual Extrinsic Error（事实型外在幻觉）","note":" \n输入里没提到，输出里“自动补充”了，且补充的这个事虽然在上下文里没有，但是在现实世界里可能存在"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwlxxewscg0","created":1754611713464,"text":"Non-Factual Extrinsic Error（虚假型外在幻觉）","note":" \n同样输出里“自动补充”了输入里面没有的事情，但是这个事情在现实世界里也没有或无从查证"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dbwsg610uy80","created":1754630069430,"text":"无中生有型","priority":1,"note":"我认为可以代表那些在现实世界压根不存在的事情被“”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwsg6ws7ww0","created":1754630071350,"text":"事实错误型","priority":2},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dbwshj2x5fk0","created":1754630176207,"text":"模糊废话型","priority":3},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}